{"id": "DF14", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，入职满 1 年的员工可享受 5 天年假 [1]。  \n带薪年假需提前 3 个工作日通过 OA 系统提交申请，经部门负责人审批后生效 [1]。  \n若您指的是其他类型的带薪假（如病假），病假期间工资按公司薪酬制度发放，但未明确具体天数 [1]。  \n如需进一步确认，建议查阅员工手册或咨询人事部门。  \n\n引用：  \n[1] 员工手册（Demo 知识库）", "sources": ["员工手册.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 2571, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF15", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，年假最高累计 20 天 [1]。因此，年假最多可攒 20 天。", "sources": ["员工手册.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1732, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF16", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，请病假需在返岗后 3 个工作日内补交医院诊断证明或医嘱 [1]。  \n知识库中未找到关于感冒请病假的其他特殊材料要求。", "sources": ["员工手册.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1820, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
