{"id": "DF18", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，密码重置需在 IAM 系统自助完成，重置后 24 小时内生效 [1]。知识库中未提及具体重置完成时间，仅说明生效时限。", "sources": ["IT支持手册.md", "员工手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1661, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
