{"id": "DF20", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，LightCube 3.0 数据中台兼容的数据源支持 19 种，包括 MySQL、PostgreSQL、Kafka、SQL Server、Oracle、Hive、Redis、MongoDB、Elasticsearch 等 [1]。", "sources": ["产品FAQ.txt", "IT支持手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1787, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF21", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，报销单需在OA系统填写并上传发票 [1]。具体流程为：员工在OA填写报销单并上传发票，然后由部门负责人审批，财务审核后打款至工资卡 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "IT支持手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 2065, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC13", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，杭州属于一线城市（北京、上海、广州、深圳、杭州），因此餐饮补贴标准为 **150 元/天** [1]。若与客户用餐，需提前报备，凭发票实报实销 [1]。", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "报销制度.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1945, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC14", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，飞机票需提前 7 天订票可享折扣价 [1]。  \n引用：[1]", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "员工手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1837, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC15", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，出差住宿费标准为：一线城市（北京、上海、广州、深圳、杭州）500 元/晚，其他城市 350 元/晚，需凭发票实报实销，超出部分自理 [1][2]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1723, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": false, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC16", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库中的报销制度，培训费每年有2000元的额度，适用于部门内培训 [1]。  \n知识库中未找到其他关于培训费报销额度的相关依据。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "员工手册.md"], "iterations": 1, "elapsed_ms": 3547, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC17", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，出差期间周六日不计加班 [1]；法定节假日出差按加班计算 [1]。因此，出差赶上周末干活不算加班，但如果是法定节假日出差则按加班计算。\n\n引用：[1]", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "员工手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1760, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC18", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "出差结束后 3 个工作日内于 OA 系统提交发票 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 2972, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC19", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，普通费用报销在财务审核通过后，5 个工作日内打款至员工工资卡 [1]。紧急报销可联系财务加急，1 个工作日内处理 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "员工手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1820, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF22", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，入职满 1 年的员工年假为 5 天 [1]。", "sources": ["员工手册.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1800, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
