{"id": "DF24", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "电脑、打印机等办公设备故障，可通过邮件 it-support@company.com 提交工单，并注明设备编号。IT 部门会在工作日 1 小时内响应 [1]。", "sources": ["IT支持手册.md", "产品FAQ.txt"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1570, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF25", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，连续输错 5 次密码将被锁号，需联系 IT 部门解锁 [1]。", "sources": ["IT支持手册.md", "产品FAQ.txt"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1621, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF26", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，出差餐饮补贴标准如下：\n\n- 一线城市（北京、上海、广州、深圳、杭州）：150 元/天。\n- 其他城市：100 元/天。\n\n若与客户用餐，需提前报备，凭发票实报实销 [1]。\n\n引用来源：[1]", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "报销制度.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1970, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": false, "hit5": false, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": "检索未命中: 期望['员工手册.md'] 实际['差旅政策.md', '报销制度.md']"}, "detail": "检索未命中: 期望['员工手册.md'] 实际['差旅政策.md', '报销制度.md']"}
{"id": "DF27", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，办公区打印机为无线打印，员工持工牌在打印终端刷卡取件；在浏览器上传文件即可发起打印。[1]", "sources": ["IT支持手册.md", "报销制度.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1824, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC20", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，出差需提前 2 天在 OA 系统提交出差申请 [1]。", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "员工手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1691, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC21", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库中的差旅政策，高铁标准为二等座，未提及一等座允许乘坐，因此坐高铁不能坐一等座 [1]。\n\n如需进一步确认，建议咨询相关部门或查阅最新政策。", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "报销制度.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1965, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC22", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库中的差旅政策，自驾补贴标准为每公里 0.8 元，即每公里 8 毛钱，需附里程记录 [1]。", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "报销制度.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1807, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC23", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，发票丢失需补开或出具情况说明，经部门负责人签字 [1]。具体操作可参考报销制度中的相关说明 [1]。  \n知识库中未提供更详细的补办流程，建议联系财务确认后续步骤 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 2163, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC24", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，与客户用餐的报销规定如下：需提前报备，凭发票实报实销 [1]。具体流程为：在 OA 系统填写报销单并上传发票，经部门负责人审批，财务审核后打款至工资卡 [2]。请注意，报销需在出差结束后 3 个工作日内提交 [1][2]。\n\n[1] 差旅政策（Demo 知识库：docs 库）\n[2] 报销制度（Demo 知识库：docs 库）", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "报销制度.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 2225, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC25", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "报销被驳回的常见原因包括：发票抬头错误、超出报销标准、缺少明细 [1]。建议您先核对发票信息是否准确、费用是否符合对应类别标准（如住宿费一线城市500元/晚、其他城市350元/晚，餐饮费一线城市150元/天、其他城市100元/天），以及是否附上了必要的采购清单或行程单等材料 [1]。若需进一步处理，可联系财务部门咨询具体驳回原因 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "IT支持手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 2301, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC26", "type": "表格", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库中的报销制度，报销标准表里一共有 **5 个费用类别**，分别是：交通费、住宿费、餐饮费、办公用品、培训费 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1372, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": false, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": "回答缺要点: ans=根据知识库中的报销制度，报销标准表里一共有 **5 个费用类别**，分别是：交通费、住宿费、餐饮费、办公用品、培训费 [1]。"}, "detail": "回答缺要点: ans=根据知识库中的报销制度，报销标准表里一共有 **5 个费用类别**，分别是：交通费、住宿费、餐饮费、办公用品、培训费 [1]。"}
{"id": "DC27", "type": "表格", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库中的报销制度，交通费的标准为“实报实销”，需凭发票报销 [1]。此外，差旅政策中补充说明，出租车费用凭行程单实报实销，单日上限为 200 元 [2]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1717, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC28", "type": "表格", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库中的报销制度，住宿费标准为：一线城市 500 元/晚，其他城市 350 元/晚 [1]。差旅政策中也明确了一线城市（北京、上海、广州、深圳、杭州）为 500 元/晚，其他城市为 350 元/晚 [2]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 2180, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC29", "type": "表格", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据报销制度，一线城市住宿标准为 500 元/晚，其他城市为 350 元/晚，因此一线城市比其他城市每晚贵 150 元 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 2132, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC30", "type": "表格", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，餐饮费标准明确标注为“出差期间”的补贴，因此仅限出差期间报销，平时不能报 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1719, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC31", "type": "表格", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，办公用品单笔限额为 500 元以下，需附采购清单 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1634, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC32", "type": "表格", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，培训费报销额度为每年 2000 元，用于部门内培训 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "员工手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1605, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC33", "type": "表格", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，差旅政策中的住宿标准分为两档：一线城市（北京、上海、广州、深圳、杭州）为500元/晚，其他城市为350元/晚 [1]。", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "报销制度.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1782, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC34", "type": "表格", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，一线城市（北京、上海、广州、深圳、杭州）的餐饮补贴为 150 元/天，住宿标准为 500 元/晚 [1]。", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "报销制度.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1750, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
