{"id": "DC36", "type": "多文档", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容：\n\n- **出差住宿标准**：一线城市（北京、上海、广州、深圳、杭州）500元/晚，其他城市350元/晚，需凭发票实报实销，超出部分自理 [1][2]。\n- **报销打款时限**：普通费用报销在财务审核通过后5个工作日内打款至工资卡 [1]。\n\n引用：\n[1] 报销制度（Demo 知识库：docs 库）\n[2] 差旅政策（Demo 知识库：docs 库）", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 2233, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC37", "type": "多文档", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，高铁座位规定为二等座 [2]；电子发票支持 PDF 与截图上传 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1646, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC38", "type": "多文档", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容：\n\n1. **自驾补贴标准**：按每公里 0.8 元补贴，需附里程记录 [2]。\n2. **办公用品报销限额**：单笔 500 元以下，需附采购清单 [1]。\n\n引用：\n- [1] 报销制度（Demo 知识库：docs 库）\n- [2] 差旅政策（Demo 知识库：docs 库）", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1956, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
